{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47997","headline":"同鹿门少年马绍隆冥游诗 一 · 庞德公","name":"同鹿门少年马绍隆冥游诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年故国岁华奔，一柱高台已断魂。\n唯有岘亭清夜月，与君长啸学苏门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞德公","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}